const aboutText =
    '<span>ETNow.in, India’s leading English business news website, is a one-stop solution for all your business news related needs. The platform offers news, views, features, visual stories, explainers, interviews, analysis, etc. from the world of <a href="/markets">Stock Market</a>, Economy, <a href="/markets/ipo">IPOs</a>, <a href="/mutual-funds">Mutual Funds</a>, Income Tax related news, <a href="/personal-finance">Personal Finance</a> related tips and tricks, in addition with latest updates and developments from other relevant domains, that too in the easiest language. ETNow.in is loved, read, watched, subscribed and recommended by top business leaders, industry experts, economists, top researchers, and who\'s who of the business fraternity. The biggest strength of ETNow.in lies in its jargon-free language offered in the articles, so that our readers and audience can comfortably decode the toughest of business news and trending topics like complex earnings details, results, revenue sheets and research documents in the easy, simple and understandable language. <br />ET Now is a part of the Times Network, the broadcast division of India’s largest media conglomerate, The Times Group. With the brand ethos, ‘Rise with India’, ET Now is dedicated to the cause of India’s development and aims to empower the discerning Indian to participate in and influence the nation’s growth story. <a href="/live-tv">ET Now Live TV</a> channel sharply differentiates itself from other business channels with its focus beyond markets and finance to content around development, economy, government, and policy issues. ET Now business news channel engages with viewers in 16 countries across the globe.</span>';
